/T (Five of the Lebob members involved themselves at a robotics stall at the annual Perth Royal Show. This was done as part of an initiative with Curtin University, who partnered with the Department of Primary Industries and Regional Development \(DPIRD\) and Murdoch University to inspire those coming to the stall to do robotics, with a free robot driving session.)
/E (Five of the Lebob members involved themselves at a robotics stall at the annual Perth Royal Show. This was done as part of an initiative with Curtin University, who partnered with the Department of Primary Industries and Regional Development \(DPIRD\) and Murdoch University to inspire those coming to the stall to do robotics, with a free robot driving session.)
