/S /H4
/P 83 0 R
/T (As part of plan to support and encourage other robotics teams, Team Lebob maintains an open source GitHub repository where anyone can access our FIRST competition resources, documentation and code. By making these materials publicly available, we aim to help upcoming teams get started, learn from our previous experiences and understand how we structure our programming and competition preparation. We believe that sharing our knowledge and resources helps strengthen the wider robotics community and makes STEM more accessible to everyone.)
/E (As part of plan to support and encourage other robotics teams, Team Lebob maintains an open source GitHub repository where anyone can access our FIRST competition resources, documentation and code. By making these materials publicly available, we aim to help upcoming teams get started, learn from our previous experiences and understand how we structure our programming and competition preparation. We believe that sharing our knowledge and resources helps strengthen the wider robotics community and makes STEM more accessible to everyone.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
