/T (Prior to the season, we started modelling a basic drivebase on onshape, allowing us to test new wheels, and connect it to a controller to check whether every component was functioning properly. The Mark 1 robot was far from perfect with minimal wire management and lots of tape but provided us with a good base to configure our components and determine relative movement.)
/E (Prior to the season, we started modelling a basic drivebase on onshape, allowing us to test new wheels, and connect it to a controller to check whether every component was functioning properly. The Mark 1 robot was far from perfect with minimal wire management and lots of tape but provided us with a good base to configure our components and determine relative movement.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [13]
>>
