732 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 88 0 R
/T (Our Mark 3 robot is the final iteration which we will use for regionals FTC competition. It includes machine cut sections of metal for our drivetrain and better material components for structural integrity. We also improved the intake by make it the full width of the robot, and created a mechanism to rotate the angle of the shooter, allowing us to shoot from almost any position on the game field. We also incorporated a flower pollen ramp for another access to pollen. A key part of the mark 2 we kept was the ball path. )
/E (Our Mark 3 robot is the final iteration which we will use for regionals FTC competition. It includes machine cut sections of metal for our drivetrain and better material components for structural integrity. We also improved the intake by make it the full width of the robot, and created a mechanism to rotate the angle of the shooter, allowing us to shoot from almost any position on the game field. We also incorporated a flower pollen ramp for another access to pollen. A key part of the mark 2 we kept was the ball path. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
