/P 89 0 R
/T (Furthermore, an Odometry pod was mounted below the motors and was connected to an omni wheel, this allowed us to calculate the shooting angle needed to score in the hive from almost any angle as well as generally improving auto accuracy. )
/E (Furthermore, an Odometry pod was mounted below the motors and was connected to an omni wheel, this allowed us to calculate the shooting angle needed to score in the hive from almost any angle as well as generally improving auto accuracy. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
840 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
