1004 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (The ball path shape was kept similar from mark 2 for mark 3. A change was that we incorporated a hood and lowered the height of the shooter so we have a smaller ball path. The main idea of the ball path was to maintain contact with the pollen throughout the entire robot through rollers. )
/E (The ball path shape was kept similar from mark 2 for mark 3. A change was that we incorporated a hood and lowered the height of the shooter so we have a smaller ball path. The main idea of the ball path was to maintain contact with the pollen throughout the entire robot through rollers. )
