/T (Team Lebob used an encoder to track and adjust the shooter hood so we can have a reliable and consistent launch angle. The encoder allows us to adjust shooting by providing us with data to find how much power we should use for each angle, allowing us to have a robot shooting from multiple different positions.)
/E (Team Lebob used an encoder to track and adjust the shooter hood so we can have a reliable and consistent launch angle. The encoder allows us to adjust shooting by providing us with data to find how much power we should use for each angle, allowing us to have a robot shooting from multiple different positions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [20]
