/T (An important aspect of our drivetrain was transferring power from the motors to the wheels efficiently. We incorporated a geared transmission system, allowing the motors to drive the wheels while maintaining a compact arrangement within the chassis. The positioning of these components was carefully considered to accommodate the drivetrain hardware without interfering with the surrounding mechanisms.)
/E (An important aspect of our drivetrain was transferring power from the motors to the wheels efficiently. We incorporated a geared transmission system, allowing the motors to drive the wheels while maintaining a compact arrangement within the chassis. The positioning of these components was carefully considered to accommodate the drivetrain hardware without interfering with the surrounding mechanisms.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
