/T (We also considered motor efficiency when selecting our components, eventually opting for bare motors for the drivetrain. This decision was intended to improve the efficiency of our powertrain while maintaining the performance required for competition. Integrating the motors and gearing within the chassis required careful consideration of mounting positions, alignment and available space.)
/E (We also considered motor efficiency when selecting our components, eventually opting for bare motors for the drivetrain. This decision was intended to improve the efficiency of our powertrain while maintaining the performance required for competition. Integrating the motors and gearing within the chassis required careful consideration of mounting positions, alignment and available space.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
