/Title (Lebob is an independent, not-for-profit robotics team based in Perth, Western Australia. Lebob competes in FIRST Tech Challenge as team #29550, with our team competing in our 1st FTC event. Lebob is not a school team but most of our members attend Perth Modern School. We started Lebob ourselves and run it under Lebob Robotics, an unincorporated not-for-profit association with its own ABN. Lebob enters competitions independently and raises our own sponsorship.)
