/Title (Another initiative by Lebob was a robot showcase at Perth Modern School. With permission from teachers, we organised a session for Year 7 students to introduce them to STEM by showcasing one of our FRC robots. Students were given the opportunity to drive the robot in a classroom environment and interact with the team by asking questions about its mechanisms, engineering decisions and design process. This provided students with a workshop style introduction to robotics while encouraging their engagement in robotics and showcasing the opportunities available through FIRST programs.)
