/Title (Pocketing was used on the drivebase plates to remove excess material and decrease weight. This makes our robot faster and lighter. We made the mistake of not having a solid channel through the middle of the robot, which caused the ball to get stuck inside the pocketing of the bottom plate. To fix this, we added a long plastic sheet, allowing the ball to move through smoothly. For our wheels, we calculated the optimal belt and pulley ratios for the right balance between speed and torque.)
