5818 0 obj
<<
/Title (Our drivetrain concepts also evolved as we considered the advantages and disadvantages of mecanum and swerve drive. We recognised the trade offs between manoeuvrability, mechanical complexity and reliability, placing greater importance on developing a stable and effective system rather than introducing unnecessary features.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5767 0 R
/Prev 5817 0 R
/First 5827 0 R
/Last 5828 0 R
/Count -4
/Next 5804 0 R
>>
endobj
5819 0 obj
<<
/Title (Prior to the season, we started modelling a basic drivebase on onshape, allowing us to test new wheels, and connect it to a controller to check whether every component was functioning properly. The Mark 1 robot was far from perfect with minimal wire management and lots of tape but provided us with a good base to configure our components and determine relative movement.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5807 0 R
/Next 5829 0 R
>>
endobj
